her being confirmed

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.216
was the right decision.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:24.818
Is that too much of
a leading question?

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.920
- A little bit too much
of a leading question.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.355 line:0%
If the decision was
going to be made,

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.790 line:0%
it was the right decision.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.793
That is, she was
highly qualified.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:37.363
She is as qualified
as Merrick Garland,

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:41.601
but Merrick Garland should
have been confirmed as well.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.837
So I object to the process.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:47.640
I think the Republicans stole
a seat on the Supreme Court

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:51.911
from the Democrats and that
was improper back in 1990,

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.247
in 2016, that was wrong.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.149 align:start size:84% position:16%
And they established
