by the Senator for Alaska.

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.664 align:start size:84% position:16%
She said she
opposed the process,

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.299 align:start size:84% position:16%
but she didn't
want to take it out

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.034
on a highly qualified justice.

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:18.138 align:start position:0%
So yes, she's highly
qualified, no doubt about that.

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.508
- When we get into
the hypocrisy game

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:24.544
of what the Republicans did
just a couple of years ago,

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:27.147
and some of the things that
the Democrats are saying,

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.983
there's nobody that's
innocent in that right,

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:31.484
at this point?

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:34.988
- It started with Bork.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.290
We have a verb now
to Bork somebody,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.295
it then moved to abolishing
the cloture and filibuster

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.666
first on all judges then
on Supreme Court justices.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.870 align:start size:97% position:3%
And now of course, this
morning already AOC and others

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.673
