the court be packed.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.376
There's a big op-ed or in
today's New York Times,

00:02:56.376 --> 00:03:00.480 align:start size:88% position:13%
a series of op-eds about
how to fix the court.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.714 line:0%
I mean the only thing broken

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.551 line:0%
about the court today
essentially is that

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:06.853
