tried to fix the court

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:13.793
if the shoe were
on the other foot.

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:16.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if it was six to three
in favor of liberals,

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.498
they only want to fix it,

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:21.834 align:start position:0%
because they want their ideology
to dominate on the court.

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:25.305
- So I'm curious back in 2013,

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:28.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
when Harry Reed, you know,
did the nuclear option,

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.410
I was a lefty, I
was a big liberal,

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.911
I was a Democrat,
the whole thing

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.546
and there is video on YouTube

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:36.816
people can find it of me
saying this is a bad move.

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:38.351
It will be used against us.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:41.354
That's exactly what Mitch
McConnell said back then.

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.422
What were you saying?

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:43.256
- Same thing.

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:44.190
Same thing.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.658
Look, I've always taken the view

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:47.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I put the institution
of the Supreme Court,

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:50.330
the country before
partisan politics.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what got me in
trouble with so many of my

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.867
so-called liberal friends

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.637 align:start size:97% position:3%
who wouldn't understand a
liberal if they fell over one,

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.973 align:start size:88% position:13%
liberal friends who
object to the fact that

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:01.841
I defended the constitution

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:04.043 align:start position:0%
when the House of
Representatives tried to impeach

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:08.481
President Trump who I voted
against in the 2016 election

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:11.384
on unconstitutional grounds.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:13.519
I favor the constitution and

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:16.589
