Martha's Vineyard.

00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:20.920 align:start size:97% position:3%
I can't have discussions with
members of my own family.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.555
They just know the truth,

00:10:22.555 --> 00:10:24.423
they want the outcome they want

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:28.294
and anything that stands in
the way of that is fascism.

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:31.631
So I'm now fascist because
I believe in due process

00:10:32.765 --> 00:10:34.500
- Hey, you're in good company.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:35.735
All right.

00:10:35.735 --> 00:10:37.036
So we'll obviously
spend a lot more time

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.938
