00:10:38.938 --> 00:10:41.007
but I just let's dive into
it a little bit more here,

00:10:41.007 --> 00:10:42.775 align:start size:88% position:13%
because I think a lot
of people watching this,

00:10:42.775 --> 00:10:44.276
especially just, you know

00:10:44.276 --> 00:10:46.512 align:start size:97% position:3%
basically a week before
the election, at this point

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:49.048 align:start size:88% position:13%
they're feeling that
these are people who are

00:10:49.048 --> 00:10:51.450
lifetime, moderate conservatives

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.652
or moderate liberals who now

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:54.687 align:start size:84% position:16%
family members
won't talk to them.

00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:56.555 align:start size:88% position:13%
They're being pushed out
of their communities.

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:58.057
When, do you remember as someone

00:10:58.057 --> 00:10:59.558
that comes from
the institutions,

00:10:59.558 --> 00:11:00.793
that comes from Harvard,

00:11:00.793 --> 00:11:03.095
that has been in the
media game for decades

00:11:03.095 --> 00:11:06.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you remember, was there
a moment that you saw

00:11:06.465 --> 00:11:09.402 align:start size:97% position:3%
that you got, whoa, this thing
