00:11:09.402 --> 00:11:11.003
- Yeah, I think

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:13.139
it really did come to fruition

00:11:13.139 --> 00:11:15.307
with the election
of Donald Trump,

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:18.878 align:start size:88% position:13%
who did reflect a
division in the country.

00:11:18.878 --> 00:11:21.113 align:start size:97% position:3%
Look, there's still some
