00:12:13.299 --> 00:12:16.335
I want to know whether
the laptop is genuine.

00:12:16.335 --> 00:12:20.473
I want that to influence
my vote one way or another.

00:12:20.473 --> 00:12:24.410 align:start position:0%
Maybe it's not enough to change
my current predisposition

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.711
but I'm entitled to know.

00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:27.413
And Twitter and Facebook and NPR

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:30.116
are not entitled to keep
that information from me.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.585
- Are you shocked then

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.954
at the way that the
media has crumbled

00:12:34.954 --> 00:12:37.690
in conjunction with all of this,

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.692 align:start size:88% position:13%
because you know I'll
see a lot of times when,

00:12:39.692 --> 00:12:42.294
when you go on CNN or
or now you go on Fox

00:12:42.294 --> 00:12:43.829
or whatever it might be,

00:12:43.829 --> 00:12:45.531
and by the way Fox is the
only one that puts me on,

00:12:45.531 --> 00:12:47.867
- CNN has banned
me as well, yeah.

00:12:47.867 --> 00:12:48.701
- Oh, they banned you?

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:49.935
Congratulations.

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:52.271
But I see you when
you've gone on there,

00:12:52.271 --> 00:12:54.673
I suddenly see people
who you've taught,

00:12:54.673 --> 00:12:56.809
people that were your
former colleagues,

00:12:56.809 --> 00:12:59.145 align:start size:97% position:3%
people that that you
might've even learned from,

00:12:59.145 --> 00:13:01.113
who were suddenly
going off on you

00:13:01.113 --> 00:13:02.982
in the worst sort of ways

00:13:02.982 --> 00:13:05.818 align:start size:88% position:13%
and usually have
almost no legal backing

00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:07.086
behind what they're doing.

00:13:07.086 --> 00:13:08.621
And then you get layout
a calm legal precedent,

00:13:08.621 --> 00:13:10.623
but they're basically
just calling you names.

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.691 align:start size:81% position:19%
And I'm constantly
amazed by that.

00:13:12.691 --> 00:13:13.959
- That's true of Jeffrey Toobin,

00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:16.929
and you know, Jeffrey
Toobin was my student.

00:13:16.929 --> 00:13:19.899 align:start size:88% position:13%
And the point is Jeffrey
Toobin has been wrong

00:13:19.899 --> 00:13:22.234
100% of the time

00:13:22.234 --> 00:13:24.770 align:start size:97% position:3%
when he's predicted the
outcome of court decisions.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:26.605 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I've been right, a
hundred percent of the time.

00:13:26.605 --> 00:13:28.440 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's not that I'm
smarter than Toobin,

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:32.111
it's that he allows ideology
to influence his prediction.

00:13:32.111 --> 00:13:34.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
CNN tells him essentially
how to come out,

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:37.817 align:start size:97% position:3%
'cause he doesn't want
listeners of CNN to be upset

00:13:37.817 --> 00:13:39.552
that Supreme Court
may come out in a way

00:13:39.552 --> 00:13:41.754
different from his prediction.

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:43.455
And I don't care about that.

00:13:43.455 --> 00:13:44.890
And so I get it right

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:48.260 align:start size:97% position:3%
because I don't allow ideology
to skew my predictions.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.962
I follow what Oliver
Wendell Holmes said,

00:13:49.962 --> 00:13:51.630 align:start size:84% position:16%
the job of a lawyer
is to predict

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.132
in fact what the courts will do,

00:13:53.132 --> 00:13:55.467
not what the courts should do.

00:13:55.467 --> 00:13:56.969
So Toobin has gotten it wrong,

00:13:56.969 --> 00:13:59.405 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I've asked CNN probably
why I've been banned,

00:13:59.405 --> 00:14:02.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been asking CNN show
Toobin's predictions,

00:14:02.541 --> 00:14:04.076
and then show what happened

00:14:04.076 --> 00:14:07.379
so that the listeners and
the viewers can judge him

00:14:07.379 --> 00:14:10.482 align:start size:97% position:3%
and decide whether to
listen to what he has to say

00:14:10.482 --> 00:14:13.185
then show my predictions
and show what happened.

00:14:13.185 --> 00:14:14.620
They, of course won't do that,

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.990
'cause people don't care
really about the truth.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.692 align:start size:81% position:19%
They only care
about their truth,

00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:21.327
their capital T truth.

00:14:22.761 --> 00:14:25.297
- So, I know that you might be
in the legal prediction game

00:14:25.297 --> 00:14:27.700
but nobody wants to be in the
political prediction game,

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.468
you know, seven days out.

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:30.970
But what do you think?

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.438
I mean, what do you think is
going to happen at this point?

00:14:32.438 --> 00:14:33.706
- I can't predict,

00:14:33.706 --> 00:14:35.975
I'm not in a position
to make that judgment.

00:14:35.975 --> 00:14:40.813 align:start position:0%
I did predict in 2016 in
August that Trump may well win.

00:14:40.813 --> 00:14:43.749 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I told that to Hillary
Clinton, who I was supporting,

00:14:43.749 --> 00:14:45.284 align:start size:84% position:16%
'cause I had just
come back from Europe

00:14:45.284 --> 00:14:48.687
and I had seen the growth of
populism, Brexit, all that.

00:14:48.687 --> 00:14:51.156
And I saw a wave
sweeping the world

00:14:51.156 --> 00:14:53.392
and I thought it would
sweep America as well.

00:14:53.392 --> 00:14:54.760
And I got that right.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:56.762
But I don't know how
to assess the polls,

00:14:56.762 --> 00:14:59.331 align:start size:84% position:16%
the polls show Biden
ahead obviously,

00:14:59.331 --> 00:15:01.000 line:0%
but we know that there's a gap

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.868 line:0%
between polls and Trump voters,

00:15:02.868 --> 00:15:04.737 line:0%
because there are a
lot of Trump voters

00:15:04.737 --> 00:15:06.739 align:start size:84% position:16%
who won't tell
pollsters the truth.

00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:09.341
So I'll be waiting
late into the night.

00:15:09.341 --> 00:15:11.977
Hopefully we'll know
the results that night

00:15:11.977 --> 00:15:14.546
'cause the last thing
I think we need is

00:15:14.546 --> 00:15:16.882 align:start size:88% position:13%
a case going to the
court over the election

00:15:16.882 --> 00:15:19.852
with the deciding vote
being cast by a justice

00:15:19.852 --> 00:15:21.086
who was just appointed by

00:15:21.086 --> 00:15:22.788
one of the litigants
to the Supreme Court.

00:15:22.788 --> 00:15:24.823
So I hope we avoid that.

00:15:24.823 --> 00:15:26.025
- Right.

00:15:26.025 --> 00:15:27.559
But doesn't it seem
in a bizarre way

00:15:27.559 --> 00:15:30.195
that that is sort of almost
where we have to end up now

00:15:30.195 --> 00:15:32.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the world has
gotten so crazy and that,

00:15:32.865 --> 00:15:34.333
you know I keep telling people,

00:15:34.333 --> 00:15:36.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
it feels like we're in
the odd stage of democracy

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:38.337
where it's now just
the show must go on.

00:15:38.337 --> 00:15:40.706
We just need the
show in an odd way

00:15:40.706 --> 00:15:42.975
to keep us all focused on that,

00:15:42.975 --> 00:15:45.344
that it would ultimately lead us

00:15:45.344 --> 00:15:46.879
to taking this to
the Supreme Court,

00:15:46.879 --> 00:15:49.014
because in a bizarre
sense, that's the show.

00:15:49.014 --> 00:15:50.916
- Well, if it goes
to the Supreme Court,

00:15:50.916 --> 00:15:54.520
I hope that whoever loses
will do what Al Gore did,

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.188
and what Richard Nixon did,

00:15:56.188 --> 00:16:00.159
and concede defeat and
have peaceful transition.

00:16:00.159 --> 00:16:02.194
Let's hope that happens.

00:16:02.194 --> 00:16:04.830
I think there's some possibility

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:08.467 align:start size:84% position:16%
the election may be
decided on that night.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:11.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
If Florida, Pennsylvania,
Ohio, Michigan,

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.539
all go for one candidate

00:16:13.539 --> 00:16:15.741
that will probably be
the winning candidate.

00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:17.943
- All right.

00:16:17.943 --> 00:16:19.445
Let me ask you one
other thing for now

00:16:19.445 --> 00:16:20.946
