on the right as well which is,

00:16:33.192 --> 00:16:35.794 align:start size:84% position:16%
oh, well the, the
lefties are so bananas

00:16:35.794 --> 00:16:38.330
and the institutions have
failed us at such a level

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.933
