What would you say
to the conservatives

00:16:50.909 --> 00:16:52.344
who now hold that position

00:16:52.344 --> 00:16:54.713 align:start size:88% position:13%
especially if Trump
loses who at that point

00:16:54.713 --> 00:16:56.949 align:start size:97% position:3%
they're all gonna say, all
right, they wanted to burn it,

00:16:56.949 --> 00:16:58.851
well now we'll show
them who's boss?

00:16:58.851 --> 00:17:01.854
- Well, I've already commented
on that with Lindsey Graham,

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:03.756
who I liked as a person.

00:17:03.756 --> 00:17:05.524
Lindsey Graham said look,

00:17:05.524 --> 00:17:08.460 align:start position:0%
I'm never going to allow a
nomination at the Supreme Court

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.928
to come within a
year of an election

00:17:09.928 --> 00:17:12.331
and you can use my
words against me.

00:17:12.331 --> 00:17:13.866
So they used his
words against him.

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:15.100
And he said, no, no, no, no no,

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.703
the rules changed
after what they did

00:17:17.703 --> 00:17:22.374 align:start size:84% position:16%
to the prior justice
to Kavanaugh,

00:17:22.374 --> 00:17:24.810 align:start size:97% position:3%
and they raised all these
fake issues about, you know,

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.311
his 15 year old.

00:17:26.311 --> 00:17:28.781
And he said, I'm going to
burn it down basically.

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:30.382 align:start size:84% position:16%
He didn't use the
words burned it down,

00:17:30.382 --> 00:17:32.017
but I'm going to
change the rules.

00:17:32.017 --> 00:17:33.552
I don't think that's right.

00:17:33.552 --> 00:17:37.122
I don't think you fight dirty
politics with dirty politics.

00:17:37.122 --> 00:17:40.826
And I hope that if whoever wins

00:17:40.826 --> 00:17:42.728
continues to play by the rules,

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:46.365
none of us will gain by a
burning it down mentality

00:17:46.365 --> 00:17:48.967 align:start size:88% position:13%
because you know who
they're gonna burn down?

00:17:48.967 --> 00:17:50.469
They're gonna burn us down.

00:17:50.469 --> 00:17:52.938 align:start size:88% position:13%
We're gonna be the guys
who they burn down.

00:17:52.938 --> 00:17:55.908 align:start size:97% position:3%
And if you think you're exempt
from that, forget about it.

00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:57.843
Just remember the
French Revolution.

00:17:57.843 --> 00:18:01.880 align:start position:0%
Nobody could get far enough
left to avoid being guillotined.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.082
Even the people who thought

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:04.750
they were leading the
French Revolution,

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.952
ended up losing their heads.

00:18:06.952 --> 00:18:09.188
When you have violence and riots

00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:11.657
and the kinds of lawlessness

00:18:11.657 --> 00:18:15.360 align:start size:97% position:3%
that I think both sides
are capable of engaging in,

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.396
the losers are our democracy.

00:18:17.396 --> 00:18:20.332
So, you know, get ready to lose,

00:18:20.332 --> 00:18:22.701 align:start size:84% position:16%
whether you're a
Democrat or Republican

00:18:22.701 --> 00:18:24.436
and then prepare
to win next time.

00:18:24.436 --> 00:18:25.938
That's the answer.

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:28.907
Don't go to the streets and
don't engage in violence.

00:18:28.907 --> 00:18:31.477
And I'm afraid we may
have some violence

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:32.978
following this election.

00:18:32.978 --> 00:18:34.313
And that's a great concern.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.115
- Yeah.

00:18:36.115 --> 00:18:37.583
Spoken like a true liberal.

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:39.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
And as a guy that's a
talking head for a living,

00:18:39.351 --> 00:18:41.186 align:start size:88% position:13%
I'd like to keep my head
attached to my body.

00:18:41.186 --> 00:18:43.555
We shall see, we shall see.

00:18:43.555 --> 00:18:46.758 align:start position:0%
All right, The DerShow is
